{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RunMapr 是一款為跑者而設的訓練分析工具，把每次跑步的心率區間與路線地圖結合，讓你瞭解自己在不同強度下的表現。無論是備戰比賽，還是日常練跑，都可透過區間累積時間與地圖細節掌握訓練節奏。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>心率區間地圖分析</h2>\n<p>每次訓練按心率區間整理，一眼看清各區間累積時間與本週分佈。選定記錄後可放大路線地圖，逐點查看配速、心率與區間。輸入最大心率即自動計算區間，亦可自行覆蓋；支援 HealthKit，Apple Watch 記錄可直接使用，並可按距離、日期或類型搜尋舊訓練。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-113-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-114-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-115-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-116-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-117-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RunMapr: Run Map &amp; HR Zones</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T13:38:45.824136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}